#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:3
#: c25a1eeb181f4cdb8606286f8781ff89
msgid "周期溶剂盒（Solvent Box Fill）"
msgstr "Solvent Box Fill"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:5
#: e0b5dd0a8026486e884a506634eabfc0
msgid "**分类：** 分子与溶剂"
msgstr "**Category:** Molecules and Solvation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:7
#: 94d3696e2b7d4ed098079ce04e699499
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:9
#: 8c4d4e898d9a42b6b6e61d6fa008f083
#
msgid ""
"`周期溶剂盒` 保留宿主结构，并在已有 cell 的整个体积内随机插入同一种溶剂分子。输入可以没有原子，但必须有有限、非奇异的 "
"cell，并且至少开启一个周期方向。"
msgstr ""
"`Solvent Box Fill` preserves the host structure and randomly inserts "
"molecules of one solvent species throughout the volume of its existing "
"cell. The input may contain no atoms, but it must have a finite, "
"nonsingular cell with at least one periodic direction enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:11
#: dc5cad91882b4086bc87ae453eb2459f
#
msgid "它用于补充整盒溶剂环境；若目标是围绕离子或指定原子构造第一溶剂壳，应使用 `局部溶剂壳`。"
msgstr "Use it to add full-box solvent environments. To construct a first solvent shell around ions or specified atoms, use `Solvent Shell` instead."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:13
#: 56394820e726484fa187bc975e2bb848
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:15
#: c02672a25c2f47ce9b84ab8b415fc5a8
msgid ""
"`固定分子数`直接使用用户给定数量。`按密度估算`根据晶胞体积 $V$、目标密度 $\\rho$、 填充比例 $p$ 和单个溶剂分子摩尔质量 "
"$M$ 计算"
msgstr ""
"`Fixed molecule count` uses the requested count directly. `Estimate from "
"density` computes it from cell volume $V$, target density $\\rho$, fill "
"fraction $p$, and the molar mass $M$ of one solvent molecule:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:18
#: f618efdf175943f287a646637b156ac3
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{solv}}=\n"
"\\max\\!\\left(1,\\operatorname{round}\n"
"\\frac{\\rho\\,(V\\times10^{-24})\\,p}{M/N_A}\\right),\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:24
#: 5d708f06c8a94b40be27ad8de3f1de8a
msgid ""
"其中 $V$ 用 Å³、$\\rho$ 用 g/cm³、$M$ 用 g/mol。这里使用完整 cell "
"体积，不扣除宿主、已有溶剂或真空层占据的体积。"
msgstr ""
"Here, $V$ is in Å³, $\\rho$ in g/cm³, and $M$ in g/mol. The calculation "
"uses the full cell volume without subtracting the volume occupied by the "
"host, existing solvent, or vacuum regions."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:26
#: 52bdec1c19d04b839687959cce562d84
msgid "每次试放会随机选择分子中心和整体取向。原子对 $i,j$ 的接受条件是"
msgstr ""
"Each placement attempt samples a random molecular center and overall "
"orientation. An atom pair $i,j$ is accepted when"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:28
#: 86acbcbf1bb344bd8b9959891783b483
msgid ""
"\n"
"d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}} \\ge\n"
"\\begin{cases}\n"
"d_{\\min}, & d_{\\min}>0,\\\\\n"
"s(R_i+R_j), & d_{\\min}=0,\n"
"\\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:36
#: 47654ebffa144c819c4748e21d0950fe
msgid ""
"其中 $d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ 是只沿已开启周期方向计算的最小镜像距离，$R_i$、$R_j$ 是元素碰撞半径，$s$ "
"是间距倍率。统一最小距离和元素半径规则是**二选一**，不会叠加。"
msgstr ""
"Here, $d_{ij}^{\\mathrm{MIC}}$ is the minimum-image distance evaluated "
"only along enabled periodic directions, $R_i$ and $R_j$ are element "
"collision radii, and $s$ is the spacing factor. The global minimum-"
"distance rule and the element-radius rule are **mutually exclusive**; "
"they are not combined."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:38
#: 05bf65dfdb794028bdc97012ed9456e0
msgid "卡片只生成未经平衡的初始结构；密度模式中的 $\\rho$ 是数量估算输入，不代表输出已达到液体平衡密度。"
msgstr ""
"The card produces un-equilibrated starting structures only. In density "
"mode, $\\rho$ is an input for estimating molecule count; it does not mean"
" the output has reached the equilibrium liquid density."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:40
#: 5ccead903b5645f9bad8fcd6a4374a83
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:42
#: 6c29e443be0b4748ac55d49c9cd11c47
msgid "场景：模型只见过真空表面，没有见过周期溶剂盒"
msgstr "Scenario: The model has seen vacuum surfaces but no periodic solvent box"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:44
#: 93404f2c5da4462e87f02bf9b35a7bfd
#
msgid ""
"你要训练一个界面或溶液体系的 NEP，但已有训练集主要是干表面和单分子吸附构型。先准备带 cell 的周期输入结构，用 `周期溶剂盒` "
"插入固定数量或按密度估算的水分子，生成一批整盒初态。"
msgstr ""
"For an interface or solution NEP whose data are mostly dry surfaces and "
"single adsorbates, begin from a periodic cell and insert a fixed or "
"density-estimated solvent count to propose full-box initial states."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:46
#: 498dccbaece04399aa954f9151e05cbd
msgid ""
"参数设置：`count_mode=\"fixed\"`，`solvent_count=200`，`sampling_mode=\"general\"`，`min_distance=0.8`，`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`，打开"
" `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）。"
msgstr ""
"Settings: `count_mode=\"fixed\"`, `solvent_count=200`, "
"`sampling_mode=\"general\"`, `min_distance=0.8`, and "
"`max_attempts_per_solvent=500`; enable `Use random seed` (`use_seed`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:48
#: 3b6a1e411c974c5ea05d67738c5eb6f6
msgid "检查输出时重点看是否插满、是否存在明显短接触、溶剂是否都包回 cell 内，以及后续预松弛是否大面积崩坏。"
msgstr ""
"Check whether the target count was reached, short contacts exist, "
"molecules lie within the periodic cell, and pre-relaxation remains "
"stable."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:50
#: f6a6290364484a5185ed277dd25719d0
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:52
#: 3b773780439d4d728e3bccc0bfa85a55
msgid "溶剂输入"
msgstr "Solvent input"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:54
#: 760983b5ebc143c6baf9397a00d413d3
msgid "溶剂 XYZ（solvent_xyz）"
msgstr "solvent_xyz"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:56
#: 6bcf1c5d352647ed9acd2e45e8b8d95b
msgid "`str`，默认是一个三原子水分子 XYZ。这里保存溶剂分子文本，而不是文件路径。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default a three-atom water XYZ block. Stores molecule text, not a "
"path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:58
#: 67eb216ba96b40fa841215a401330264
msgid "每个输入的独立输出数（structures）"
msgstr "structures"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:60
#: 261440620ce34b1bb6d372d76417c036
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成多少个独立填充版本。"
msgstr "`int`, default `1`. Independent box-fill variants per input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:62
#: 8aa30724adb04cf58999cb271671eb33
msgid "数量控制"
msgstr "Count control"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:64
#: d875bf378d1a4213a887a77ddff21e9d
msgid "目标用量（count_mode）"
msgstr "count_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:66
#: e421777f77f1475dbef5f4939fc0667d
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `density`。可选 `fixed`、`按密度`（`density`）。`fixed` "
"直接使用目标分子数；`按密度`（`density`）根据**完整 cell 体积**、溶剂分子质量、目标密度和数量乘数估算一个名义分子数。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `density`. Available values are `fixed` and `By density` "
"(`density`). `fixed` uses the target molecule count directly. `By "
"density` estimates a nominal molecule count from the **full cell "
"volume**, solvent molecular mass, target density, and count multiplier."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:68
#: 9d6bd8aa9e094ede94422dd6f2183687
msgid "目标溶剂分子数（solvent_count）"
msgstr "solvent_count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:70
#: 8e010cce1b514df39ba788fbd5ce4d54
msgid "`int`，默认 100，仅在主动切换到 `count_mode=\"fixed\"` 后生效。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 100. Used only after explicitly switching to "
"`count_mode=\"fixed\"`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:72
#: 2c23479a8ad24455b6b49666bae38080
msgid "按密度（density）"
msgstr "density"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:74
#: 493666ea4ee242ea9da812fcf4d611e0
msgid "`float`，默认 1.0，单位 g/cm³。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时用于估算溶剂分子数量。"
msgstr "`float`, default `1.0` g/cm³; density mode only."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:76
#: 7e89818057764499b4c6bfa30bd40071
msgid "完整 cell 计数系数（fill_packing）"
msgstr "Full-Cell Count Factor (fill_packing)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:78
#: 2a78e69898ab40e6b36b4baf581e914c
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 1.0，范围 `(0, 1]`。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时乘到完整 cell "
"的名义纯溶剂分子数上；小于 1 会降低目标数量。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 1.0, range `(0, 1]`. With `count_mode=\"density\"`, this"
" multiplies the nominal pure-solvent molecule count for the full cell. "
"Values below 1 reduce the target count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:81
#: 10b04806625a4fd8aed42e21d1fb5b6a
msgid ""
"密度模式不会扣除宿主原子、已有溶剂或真空层占据的体积，也不会根据溶质质量反算最终溶液密度。对含表面、溶质或大块固体的 cell，它只是按完整 "
"cell 体积给出的初始数量估计；请看卡片预览中的解析数量，再用 `完整 cell 计数系数`（`fill_packing`）或固定数量修正。"
msgstr ""
"Density mode does not subtract the volume occupied by host atoms, "
"existing solvent, or vacuum regions, and it does not infer the final "
"solution density from solute mass. For a cell containing a surface, "
"solute, or bulk solid, it is only an initial count estimate based on the "
"full cell volume. Check the resolved count in the card preview, then "
"correct it with `Full-cell count factor` (`fill_packing`) or a fixed "
"count."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:84
#: 0a45a87292614cd3af855db034a09163
msgid "采样和几何约束"
msgstr "Sampling and geometry constraints"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:86
#: 381eef2fba3d4bb09c57c4dde49a44a7
msgid "碰撞配置（sampling_mode）"
msgstr "sampling_mode"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:88
#: 06c6196a016c4bb285a5b73e63e2fb56
msgid "`str`，默认 `general`。界面提供三档真实有差异的间距倍率："
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `general`. The interface provides three spacing-factor "
"presets with distinct behavior:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: c15c19eb5f8241f7a85fd5984ba3b8b4
msgid "界面选项"
msgstr "Interface option"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 7446d04732564501b09b37e6ede82662
msgid "序列化值"
msgstr "Serialized value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 6cd08efb763546d2ab4968143cbbdb5b
msgid "$s$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 3375b39373c94359b4aa5ff3a095565e
msgid "效果"
msgstr "Effect"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 1f0b638f1380493ab63b3c0d3e376eb5
msgid "紧凑间距"
msgstr "Compact spacing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 1212ca8a8c284e179ee8fc8c4d2fd02a
msgid "`loose`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: c8d75a4f810845b2a2d99ebdd2b51ac8
msgid "0.62"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: efde2428c39b4d06a31e86a2241e9a11
msgid "允许分子靠得更近，更容易插满"
msgstr ""
"Allows molecules to approach more closely, making the target count easier"
" to reach"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: ccf1637e3b4a42ddb77060b420f3a528
msgid "标准间距"
msgstr "Standard spacing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 45e35ec01fed4c62bdfab0335a3898ff
msgid "`general`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: d66edfad19244d7b9d4bdfc18a2a306e
msgid "0.70"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 0f16b5d4d0f94cdf9c0bf1bf6c40a9bb
msgid "默认选择"
msgstr "Default choice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 5c0e81d7315f4720ac46c90b4fa049b5
msgid "保守间距"
msgstr "Conservative spacing"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: f42b45e5bb964ff7ac3f3e6a5842e807
msgid "`dense`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 71069c3f88ec45ecaf0285cc9e2ba295
msgid "0.78"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:80
#: 0c85259a769f4f18acad5db459538a25
msgid "留出更大原子间距，更可能提前耗尽尝试"
msgstr ""
"Leaves larger interatomic distances and is more likely to exhaust the "
"attempt budget early"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:96
#: e27f9b3916f7448bb223bfce42a05299
msgid ""
"旧工作流中的 `auto` 和 `water` 仍可加载，并按标准倍率 0.70 运行；重新在界面保存后会归一为 "
"`general`。三档都只改变碰撞间距，分子中心和整体取向始终随机。"
msgstr ""
"Legacy workflows using `auto` or `water` can still be loaded and run with"
" the standard factor of 0.70. Saving them again in the interface "
"normalizes the value to `general`. All three presets change collision "
"spacing only; molecular centers and overall orientations remain random."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:98
#: 8f2dd8d0779f4dd2a49531c441097e71
msgid "统一最小距离覆盖值（min_distance）"
msgstr "min_distance"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:100
#: e0062d14ef464d17b37baa186e721587
msgid "`float`，默认 0，单位 Å。大于 0 时，所有原子对都使用该统一距离，并禁用间距预设和元素半径倍率；等于 0 时使用元素半径规则。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0, in Å. When greater than 0, all atom pairs use this "
"uniform distance and both spacing presets and element-radius factors are "
"disabled. A value of 0 uses the element-radius rule."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:102
#: 8b988b7a062e48a1b9acfb5c9d5e1d31
msgid "元素半径碰撞缩放（collision_scale）"
msgstr "collision_scale"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:104
#: 01cd798268af415c8427b13cd831c855
msgid "`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用间距预设；大于 0 时覆盖预设。仅在 `min_distance=0` 时生效。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default 0. A value of 0 uses the spacing preset; a positive "
"value overrides the preset. It applies only when `min_distance=0`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:106
#: 09ae7ea1315f48fba4e5df53adec3b04
msgid "每个溶剂分子最大尝试次数（max_attempts_per_solvent）"
msgstr "max_attempts_per_solvent"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:108
#: ce58b1f26b154b3fb05c2e8c5866c633
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 500。总尝试上限是“该值 × "
"目标分子数”；若连续拒绝次数达到内部停滞阈值，也会提前停止。高密度盒子触顶时，优先检查目标数量和碰撞规则，再考虑增加它。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 500. The total attempt limit is this value multiplied by "
"the target molecule count; the run also stops early after the internal "
"consecutive-rejection threshold. If a dense box reaches the limit, check "
"the target count and collision rules before increasing it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:110
#: c00105f02af342b598e1d993bed3bd55
msgid "严格数量（strict_count）"
msgstr "strict_count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:112
#: f77d56012482431cb4cc0bf9981386bf
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满目标数量就失败；关闭后允许输出至少放入 1 "
"个分子的部分结果。若一个分子都放不进去，仍会报错，避免把未变化的输入标成“已填盒”。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. When enabled, failure to insert the full target "
"count is an error. When disabled, a partial result is allowed if at least"
" one molecule was inserted. Inserting none still raises an error so an "
"unchanged input is never labeled as a filled box."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:114
#: 1a6a2099cb574ba495a68f41584dddc9
msgid "柔性溶剂"
msgstr "Flexible solvent molecules"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:116
#: daabbbf904194e79a717159b46af919d
msgid "启用柔性溶剂（flex_solvent）"
msgstr "flex_solvent"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:118
#: e6db7df247e14816861d2ad5b01f2f30
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 "
"false。打开后复用“分子构象”的几何启发式拓扑生成溶剂构象池，再用于填盒。水没有可旋转单键，因此普通水盒不需要打开；打开后主要只增加高斯坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default false. When enabled, the geometric-topology heuristic "
"from `Molecular Conformers` generates a solvent conformer pool for box "
"filling. Water has no rotatable single bond, so an ordinary water box "
"does not need this option; enabling it mainly adds Gaussian coordinate "
"noise."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:120
#: 0d51ae52b98647478777fcc6ff7ddd95
msgid "柔性构象池（flex_pool）"
msgstr "flex_pool"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:122
#: f0eb6a1be85940f9aa7cedfea3439ccc
msgid "`int`，默认 32。柔性溶剂构象池大小。"
msgstr "`int`, default `32`. Size of the conformer pool for a flexible solvent."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:124
#: 63b74af8097a429da305c5b68f0750ba
msgid "柔性扭转角范围（flex_torsion_range）"
msgstr "flex_torsion_range"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:126
#: 55c3648993ff4c0bb3fc0607d37816ec
msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时附加的扭转角增量范围。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float]`, default `(-180.0, 180.0)`, in degrees. Range of "
"additional torsion-angle increments used when generating flexible "
"conformers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:128
#: 51741bf206cb4e568983e157a0fe2cb1
msgid "柔性采样最大扭转键数（flex_max_torsions）"
msgstr "flex_max_torsions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:130
#: 1c0b965919e64e5f95f869afbcc7c72f
msgid "`int`，默认 5。每个柔性构象最多扰动多少个可旋转键。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `5`. Maximum number of rotatable bonds perturbed in each "
"flexible conformer."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:132
#: 23b3755f3331461e8c84954d99ac68ee
msgid "柔性采样高斯宽度（flex_gaussian_sigma）"
msgstr "flex_gaussian_sigma"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:134
#: f189c64008534a8195e6726c9b1271fc
msgid "`float`，默认 0.03，单位 Å。柔性构象生成时叠加的坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.03` Å. Coordinate noise added while generating "
"flexible conformers."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:136
#: e46bab11f979402e86da428ea2329813
msgid "随机性"
msgstr "Randomness"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:138
#: 75c9680e88e1474ead15967bdcedd7c7
msgid "使用随机种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "Use Random Seed (use_seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:140
#: b69198985dbd4e57b936595919884d2a
msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后，同一输入结构、参数和 seed 会生成相同输出。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default `false`. When enabled, identical input, parameters, and "
"seed produce identical output."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:142
#: 6dfa17552c294d2d9bfcb8acbcdb81ee
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "Random Seed (seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:144
#: 1cb6e728294d461f803b548d5f8a5963
msgid "`int`，默认 0。`use_seed=True` 时生效。"
msgstr "`int`, default `0`. Used when `use_seed=True`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:146
#: ecfb47f773464526ba5581b2a7f9e880
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:148
#: a76de684ba5b4500900e12c4aba78363
msgid "固定数量水盒（200 个水，固定 seed）"
msgstr "Fixed-count water box (200 waters, fixed seed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:150
#: 47c1a6a01053425d8fbeb9c782633e69
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SolventBoxFillCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"structures\": 1,\n"
"    \"count_mode\": \"fixed\",\n"
"    \"solvent_count\": 200,\n"
"    \"sampling_mode\": \"general\",\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 0.8,\n"
"    \"max_attempts_per_solvent\": 500,\n"
"    \"strict_count\": true,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 42\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:168
#: 6e15810e8e2c4812877e620da50997d0
msgid "按密度填充水盒（允许部分输出）"
msgstr "Density-based water box (partial output allowed)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:170
#: 253fac391bbc4bbc927cf1ef02c0efd5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"SolventBoxFillCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"structures\": 3,\n"
"    \"count_mode\": \"density\",\n"
"    \"density\": 1.0,\n"
"    \"fill_packing\": 0.7,\n"
"    \"sampling_mode\": \"general\",\n"
"    \"min_distance\": 0.85,\n"
"    \"max_attempts_per_solvent\": 800,\n"
"    \"strict_count\": false,\n"
"    \"use_seed\": true,\n"
"    \"seed\": 7\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:189
#: ead834f4c45a489eb825e32021c08179
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:191
#: 608966fe75984978bddc17c38382d016
msgid "`周期溶剂盒 → 几何健全性过滤`：先剔除短接触和明显异常盒子。"
msgstr "`Solvent Box Fill` -> `Geometry Sanity Filter`: reject short contacts and abnormal boxes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:192
#: 395574227c3847a3862f8c4ce017a860
#
msgid "`周期溶剂盒 → FPS 代表性采样`：整盒初态很多时，用代表性采样降低 DFT 数量。"
msgstr "`Solvent Box Fill` -> `FPS Sampling`: reduce many initial boxes to representative DFT candidates."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:194
#: dd9e3f817eb8404cb009315f8c854580
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:196
#: 42e023ce4005489188cc8a90c739ffd7
#
msgid "输入没有有效周期 cell：这张卡需要非奇异 cell 和至少一个周期方向；非周期局部溶剂环境请用 `局部溶剂壳`。"
msgstr "No valid periodic cell: use a nonsingular cell with periodicity, or choose `Solvent Shell` for a nonperiodic local environment."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:197
#: 146970a2f31d49c5b2a335a4f81e25fd
msgid ""
"无法插满目标数量：先看预览中的目标分子数和名义纯溶剂密度；再降低数量或完整 cell 计数系数、减小碰撞距离，或者增大 "
"cell。关闭严格数量后可保留非零的部分结果。"
msgstr ""
"Cannot reach the target count: first inspect the target molecule count "
"and nominal pure-solvent density in the preview. Then reduce the count or"
" full-cell count factor, reduce the collision distance, or enlarge the "
"cell. Disabling strict count retains a nonzero partial result."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:198
#: 02788b06b78a48998a39b62a0ac6c67c
msgid ""
"按密度估算的数量不符合预期：数量由完整 cell 体积、溶剂分子质量、目标密度和数量乘数共同决定，不会扣除宿主占据体积。先检查 cell "
"单位、真空层、已有原子和 `溶剂 XYZ`（`solvent_xyz`）。"
msgstr ""
"The density-derived count is unexpected: it uses the full cell volume, "
"solvent molecular mass, target density, and count multiplier, without "
"subtracting the host's occupied volume. Check the cell units, vacuum "
"region, existing atoms, and `Solvent XYZ` (`solvent_xyz`)."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:199
#: 13e8755b96314a86b953db722e562009
#
msgid "想生成离子第一水合壳：改用 `局部溶剂壳`。整盒卡不会按离子元素选择 ion–O 距离或水分子取向。"
msgstr "To generate an ion's first hydration shell, use `Solvent Shell`. Whole-box filling does not choose ion–O distances or water orientations according to the ion element."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:201
#: d106fb40ee4440e196e1acbd951d8913
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:203
#: 8b27d565d4604864b87fc115aed3fe03
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`SolvBox(mode={mode},req={target},ok={placed})`"
msgstr "`SolvBox(mode={mode},req={target},ok={placed})`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:205
#: 4294de6de740423ba168e76f186ee03f
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/solvent-box-fill-card.md:207
#: bb3f3e729b2043dd87ef34d0e0faec8f
msgid ""
"打开 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 "
"`随机种子`（`seed`）会生成相同填盒结果。`count_mode=\"density\"` 时，cell 体积或 `溶剂 "
"XYZ`（`solvent_xyz`）改变会改变目标分子数，因此输出也会改变。"
msgstr ""
"With `Use random seed` (`use_seed`) enabled, the same input structures, "
"structure order, parameters, and `seed` produce the same packing result. "
"When `count_mode=\"density\"`, changing the cell volume or `solvent_xyz` "
"changes the target molecule count and therefore the output."

